%95%B4%E5%A4%87%EF%BC%9A%E6%B4%BB%E5%8A%A8%E7%AF%87&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"编辑章节：【内容前瞻】极心测试出航整备：活动篇\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<div class=\"sidebar-card\" style=\"margin:15px 0px\"><b>本文来自</b>：官方微信公众号<br /><b>原作者</b>：谜之猫本喵<br /><b>发布时间</b>：2023-09-22 19:11<br /><b>原视频/文章地址</b>：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://game.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%2FWvKpGUQHAOIJ7woXw-AzfQ\" target=\"_blank\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/WvKpGUQHAOIJ7woXw-AzfQ</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background: #FFF\">\n<p><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息192.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/7e/7wqg3rxspr8ssr5i5u99gd0u5952a2p.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF192.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"149\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/7e/7wqg3rxspr8ssr5i5u99gd0u5952a2p.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"200\" /><br /><br />\n</p>\n<center>\n<p>哼哼~人类<br />\n对<font color=\"blue\"><b>邂逅</b></font>的了解果然还是满足不了你的好奇心<br />\n简直是，不让本喵好好睡一觉啊喂——\n<br /><br />\n看在<font color=\"blue\"><b>极心测试即将在9月27日启航</b></font>的份上，<br />\n看在<font color=\"blue\"><b>本喵是混沌之海里最伟大的领航员</b></font>的份上，<br />\n看在...呃...<font color=\"blue\"><b>今天是星期五</b></font>的份上！\n<br /><br />\n本喵就再来介绍一下<br />\n<font color=\"blue\"><b>极心测试期间开放的活动</b></font>吧<br />\n人类！你可要听好了！\n<br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息233.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/4e/j4sd0ei0q7p4chzos49ucypv4fibpn2.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF233.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"1128\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/4e/j4sd0ei0q7p4chzos49ucypv4fibpn2.png/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF233.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/4/4e/j4sd0ei0q7p4chzos49ucypv4fibpn2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"2175\" /><img alt=\"官方消息234.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/ab/0g0f8etv1zadnl0491lfubk4vkp4rt3.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF234.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"1070\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/ab/0g0f8etv1zadnl0491lfubk4vkp4rt3.png/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF234.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/a/ab/0g0f8etv1zadnl0491lfubk4vkp4rt3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"2063\" /><img alt=\"官方消息235.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/79/m6znqstyeznfqe2pmsdpl36ek293k2q.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF235.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"1070\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/79/m6znqstyeznfqe2pmsdpl36ek293k2q.png/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF235.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/79/m6znqstyeznfqe2pmsdpl36ek293k2q.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"2063\" /><img alt=\"官方消息236.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/66/9zde1vhmq1q0rwon4xdcycfr6gpi5z3.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF236.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"1070\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/66/9zde1vhmq1q0rwon4xdcycfr6gpi5z3.png/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF236.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/6/66/9zde1vhmq1q0rwon4xdcycfr6gpi5z3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"2063\" />\n<br /><br />\n好了好了，今天真的没有了<br />\n再戳本喵也抖不出东西了！<br />\n本喵真的真的要去睡觉了<br />\n等到了乐土，记得叫醒喵~\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n</center>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022163732\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time 